{"text":"Dear {first_name},

This is a second reminder from {clinic_name}. It follows an earlier message about booking a follow-up visit with us.

Please call us to book your visit by {due_by}. Our phone number is {clinic_phone}.

If you do not want to get these reminders, you can stop them here: {opt_out_link}

Thank you,
{clinic_name}"}
